\code{\link[tools:R_user_dir]{tools::R_user_dir()}}), or \code{"off"} (no memoisation -- every catalog
fetch hits ESPN).
\item \code{cfbfastR.cache_duration} -- cache time-to-live in seconds.
Defaults to \code{86400} (24 hours).
